 God has you where you're meant to be today, and will lead you to where you're meant to be tomorrow.\n\nThis video was brought to you by TBN Networks®.\n\nSUBSCRIBE:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/c/TBN/featured?sub_confirmation=1\n\nFor nearly 50 years the mission of the Trinity Broadcasting Network has remained unchanged: To use every available means to reach as many individuals and families as possible with the life-changing Gospel of Jesus Christ.\n\nLaunched in 1973 by Christian television pioneers Paul and Jan Crouch, TBN began as one low-power television station broadcasting a few hours of Christian programming each day to viewers throughout the Los Angeles area. In the years since, TBN has grown into a family of over thirty twenty-four hour global networks reaching every inhabited continent with entertaining, inspirational, and life-changing programming for every family member and demographic. TBN began as a dream to “build a Christian television network that spans the whole world.” Today that dream is reality…and still expanding!\n\n#tbn #priscillashirer #godstiming \n\n00:00 Intro\n02:40 Family Memories \n10:08 Luke 9:1-2\n16:45 Standing Before God \n20:55 You Need Supernatural Capacity \n33:52 You Need God's Blessing", 'channel_id': 'UCq1BLq3MpYj0-77WKQPu5Cg', 'channel_url': 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCq1BLq3MpYj0-77WKQPu5Cg', 'duration': 2421, 'view_count': 991553, 'average_rating': None, 'age_limit': 0, 'webpage_url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DYWyQ1xFQSI', 'categories': ['Entertainment'], 'tags': ['priscilla shirer', 'priscilla shirer sermons', 'priscilla shirer 2023', 'priscilla shirer 2022', 'priscilla shirer movies', 'priscilla shirer armor of god', 'priscilla shirer bible study', 'priscilla shirer prayer', 'priscilla shirer identity in christ', 'priscilla shirer motivation', 'women support women', 'victoria osteen', 'purpose', 'timing', "god's timing", 'perfect timing', 'trinity broadcasting network', 'trinity broadcasting network live', 't